{"name": "Bad House", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/dca6bd8ea0ce7bc98ca8d8c63c988158.avif?t=1790866591\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/352360977f0065040a493b82d5ebc226.poster.avif?t=1790866591\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/352360977f0065040a493b82d5ebc226.webm?t=1790866591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/352360977f0065040a493b82d5ebc226.mp4?t=1790866591\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This property comes partially furnished with a generous selection of items left behind by the previous tenant. You're welcome to make use of everything they've left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Property includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spacious living area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secure personal storage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quiet neighbourhood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basement access*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>* Basement access is not recommended</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you hear any strange noises from the basement, it's best to ignore them. There are many rooms down there, and most people never come back up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/a0e841fa4479993bd8f58efb9a3eb1a3.avif?t=1790866591\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/dc1e6e683cf8640f22d2bc751c2f75df.poster.avif?t=1790866591\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/dc1e6e683cf8640f22d2bc751c2f75df.webm?t=1790866591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/dc1e6e683cf8640f22d2bc751c2f75df.mp4?t=1790866591\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your personal storage box is located upstairs and is available throughout your tenancy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Should you discover anything of value in the basement, you may return it to storage for future use. <i><strong>Please note that basement access points are fragile and may not remain available after use. Management is not responsible for any items abandoned in the basement.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Previous tenants thoughtfully left behind many objects in the basement, including knives, wands, amulets, rings, swords, shields, armors and other useful possessions. We encourage you to make good use of them if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"270\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/cc0a88803c1ea30e5de587c03cebd235.avif?t=1790866591\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/e837d5ec572206dc62828240024a78d0.poster.avif?t=1790866591\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/e837d5ec572206dc62828240024a78d0.webm?t=1790866591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/e837d5ec572206dc62828240024a78d0.mp4?t=1790866591\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The basement is home to a thriving community including demons, skeletons, bats, the undead, and many more unidentified occupants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Please respect the residents' personal space whenever possible.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fortunately, the property is suitable for a variety of tenants. </strong>Swap between melee and magic with Blake, use blood magic and focus on critical hit bonuses with Rory or hide in the shadows and poison your enemies with Lou\u2026. but whoever you choose, <strong>\u13d4\ud800\udf04 \ud800\udec5\ua74a\ud800\udf13\ud800\udf04 \ud800\udf19\ua74a\ud800\udf35\u2019\ud800\udf0b\ud800\udf0b \ud800\udf05\ud800\udf04\ud800\udf04\ud800\udf0b \ud800\udf10\ud800\udf09\u13f5\ud800\udec5\ud800\udf15 \ud800\udf00\ud800\udf15 \ud800\udec5\ua74a\ud800\udf0c\ud800\udf04.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/ce1b30f5912929140385f486b97c17c1.poster.avif?t=1790866591\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/ce1b30f5912929140385f486b97c17c1.webm?t=1790866591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/extras/ce1b30f5912929140385f486b97c17c1.mp4?t=1790866591\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Welcome to your new home. The previous tenant left some things. You can have them, but there's just one condition: don\u2019t go into the basement. Explore the many rooms of a mysterious basement in Bad House, an auto-battler dungeon crawler.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557870/c90401aa5161b781abd2974924357c8cb8d91d3a/header.jpg?t=1790866591", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "RPG", "Auto Battler", "Dungeon Crawler", "Mystery Dungeon", "Mystery"], "developers": "Andrew Morrish", "publishers": "Andrew Morrish", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3557870", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "1 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/lxHDOJii8fA", "first_seen": 1790805600.0, "review_rank": 47}